tpm2-tools: tpm2-tools (TPM2 command line tools)
tpm2-tools:
tpm2-tools: The tpm2-tools project provides a set of command line tools for
tpm2-tools: interacting with TPM 2.0 hardware and simulators. These tools
tpm2-tools: wrap the TCG TSS 2.0 Enhanced System API (ESAPI) and provide
tpm2-tools: access to TPM functionality including key management, encryption,
tpm2-tools: attestation, sealing, signing, random number generation, and
tpm2-tools: measurement.
tpm2-tools:
tpm2-tools: Tools include: tpm2_createprimary, tpm2_create, tpm2_sign,
tpm2-tools: tpm2_encryptdecrypt, tpm2_attestation, tpm2_pcrread, and many
tpm2-tools: more.
